{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49712","headline":"浣溪沙 十九 · 孙光宪","name":"浣溪沙 十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十五年来锦岸游，未曾行处不风流，好花长与万金酬。\n满眼利名浑信运，一生狂荡恐难休，且陪烟月醉红楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙光宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49712.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49712","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}